          "description": "Block until the next webhook (callback) arrives at an endpoint, then return it — instead of polling. Receipt alone does not prove a valid signature. Use this for async/long-running work: kick off the job with the endpoint URL as its callback, then call wait_for_callback to receive the result the moment it lands (decrypted; inspect signatureVerification when present or call verify_signature). Returns { status:",
